    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toss. Aim. Score. Urban Style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Urban Disc Golf</strong>, an arcade-inspired disc golf game where the concrete jungle becomes your playground. Whether you're curving a disc through alleyways or banking a trick shot off a rooftop, every course is packed with stylish scenery and sneaky targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate city parks, plazas, and rooftops in this low-poly 3D world, all while unlocking bonus achievements for hitting signs, bins, and hidden targets in your path. <br><br>\ud83e\udd4f <strong>Arcade-style disc golf</strong> set in an urban world</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Hit the basket</strong>... or go for <strong>bonus trick shot targets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized low-poly 3D visuals</strong> with a colorful city vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Multiple levels</strong> inspired by real city layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 <strong>Family-friendly gameplay</strong> for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple to play, challenging to master</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Relaxing single-player experience</strong>\u00a0with no timers and no stress</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toss. Aim. Score. Urban Style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Urban Disc Golf</strong>, an arcade-inspired disc golf game where the concrete jungle becomes your playground. Whether you're curving a disc through alleyways or banking a trick shot off a rooftop, every course is packed with stylish scenery and sneaky targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate city parks, plazas, and rooftops in this low-poly 3D world, all while unlocking bonus achievements for hitting signs, bins, and hidden targets in your path. <br><br>\ud83e\udd4f <strong>Arcade-style disc golf</strong> set in an urban world</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Hit the basket</strong>... or go for <strong>bonus trick shot targets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized low-poly 3D visuals</strong> with a colorful city vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Multiple levels</strong> inspired by real city layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 <strong>Family-friendly gameplay</strong> for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple to play, challenging to master</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Relaxing single-player experience</strong>\u00a0with no timers and no stress</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Sling discs through stylized cityscapes in this casual, physics-based disc golf game. Aim for the basket or rack up trick shots by bouncing discs off rooftops, signs, and benches in colorful urban environments.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201ca refreshing take on city-spun fun for both disc golf enthusiasts and lovers of arcade sports games\u201d<br>Game Daily<br><br>\u201cThis is the perfect choice for those looking for a relaxing, but at the same time dynamic gameplay.\u201d<br>MMO13<br>",
